  a neogov:Task .

neogov:Notes_and_Attachments
  xhtml:p """All Leon County employees are required to read and acknowledge the "Leon County Code of Ethics" Policy, "Conflict of Interest" Policy, the "Fraud Abuse Hotline", and policies regarding Social Media/Networking annually."""@en-US,
  """Please review the acknowledgment by clicking on each link. By signing your evaluation, you hereby acknowledge that you have read, understand, and agree to be bound by the provisions of the Leon County Code of Ordinances Article XII, "Leon County Code of Ethics," Board policy No. 16-1, "Drug and Alcohol Free Workplace", Personnel Policy No. 2.10, "Conflict of Interest," the "Fraud Abuse Hotline" and policies regarding Social Media/Networking."""@en-US ;
  neogov:Next_Section neogov:Employee_Narrative ;
  a neogov:Section .

neogov:Employee_Narrative
  rdf:_1 neogov:Listens_to_changing_needs ;
  rdf:_2 neogov:Engages_citizens_and_employees ;
  rdf:_3 neogov:Aligns_key_strategic_processes ;
  rdf:_4 neogov:Delivers_results_and_relevance ;
  rdf:_5 neogov:Strives_for_continuous_improvement ;
  a neogov:Section .

neogov:Listens_to_changing_needs
  xhtml:p """Embracing innovation and technology
(Displays adaptability, flexibility to adjust to changing priorities. Ability to look at the “big picture” and consider all the elements, both short and long term impacts in the decision making process.)

Describe how you promote the relevance (meaning, importance, connection) of the work performed or service provided to your customers. Also, describe how you have listened for changing needs in your area and have adjusted, refined or made improvements to meet new challenges or customer preferences. Lastly, discuss how you communicated to your customers that you listened."""@en-US ;
  a neogov:ITEM .

neogov:Engages_citizens_and_employees
  xhtml:p """Utilize a collaborative approach of soliciting input and feedback from employees and citizens to accomplish goals where applicable.

  Describe how you have strengthened or built relationships within the organization or through employees, citizens, business and community partnerships?"""@en-US ;
  a neogov:ITEM .
neogov:Aligns_key_strategic_processes
  xhtml:p """Aligning the key strategic processes (vision, mission, strategic priorities, strategic initiatives, business plans, program evaluations, employee evaluations, and reporting)

How have you aligned your department, division or program goals with those of the organization?"""@en-US ;
  a neogov:ITEM .
neogov:Delivers_results_and_relevance
  xhtml:p """Instilling our culture throughout the organization with our core values and practices as our drivers (how we live our core values and core practices in carrying out the Board’s vision, mission and strategic priorities)

Measuring results (not activity) and benchmarking performance - (Individual accountability for achieving departmental priorities and performance measures.)

Describe major accomplishments, successes, contributions and improvements during the past

12 months and those to be completed in the coming year and how you have reinforced our core values and core practices. Also, describe how you communicated or conveyed these results and the value derived by them to your customers."""@en-US ;
  a neogov:ITEM .
neogov:Strives_for_continuous_improvement
  xhtml:p """
  Empowering employees and encouraging a vigorous competition of ideas. Utilize strategic thinking and high level problem solving to continuously look inward and outward to better develop, define and improve processes, procedures, etc. Develop, coach and mentor direct reports. Engage in personal and professional development.

Describe how you have accomplished the above. Also, include what personal and professional development you believe would be beneficial for you in the coming year."""@en-US ;
  a neogov:ITEM .